OL,3,GNEWSAFocus on reading's benefits for
OL,4,Amental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FLibrary bosses and a charity have been
OL,7,Fraising awareness of what benefits
OL,8,Freading can have for good mental
OL,9,Fhealth.
OL,11,FGuille-Alles Library and Guernsey Mind
OL,12,Fhave formed a partnership to mark World
OL,13,FMental Health Day and encourage
OL,14,Fislanders to discover the "positive
OL,15,Fimpact" reading can have.
OL,17,FAs part of the day, a collection of
OL,18,Fbooks have been displayed at the
OL,19,Flibrary featuring subjects recommended
OL,20,Fby Guernsey Mind to help people relax
OL,21,Fand learn.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
